<title>FINLAND: AKTIA SEES CONDITIONS FOR BETTER FULL-YR EARNINGS.</title>
<headline>AKTIA SEES CONDITIONS FOR BETTER FULL-YR EARNINGS.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish bank Saastopankki Aktia Oy said in a statement on Monday it saw good conditions for improved full-year 1997 earnings.</p>
<p>&quot;Aktia's year started more or less in line with our expectations and we have good possibilities to improve our result from last year's,&quot; Aktia CEO Johan Horelli said in the statement.</p>
</text>
